            "id": 121015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bayangkan kamu adalah manajer acara dan sedang mencatat semua hal yang kamu perlukan untuk merencanakan acara yang sukses.</p><p>Kamu ingin melihat semua tabel yang kamu miliki, lalu memutuskan apakah ada tabel lama yang bisa kamu hapus.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt; &#xA;&lt;html&gt; &#xA; &lt;head&gt; &#xA;  &lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width&quot;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; &#xA;   href=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css&quot; /&gt; &#xA;  &lt;style&gt; &#xA;   @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@500&amp;display=swap'); &#xA; &#xA;   html, &#xA;   body { &#xA;    min-height: 100%; &#xA;    width: 100%; &#xA;    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   table { &#xA;    border-collapse: collapse; &#xA;    width: 40%; &#xA;    background-color: rgb(244 248 254); &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   td, &#xA;   th { &#xA;    border: 1px solid rgb(217 232 251); &#xA;    padding: 8px; &#xA;    font-size: 10px; &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   th { &#xA;    background-color: #eeeeee; &#xA;    text-align: left; &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   caption { &#xA;    font-size: 10px; &#xA;    color: rgb(50 185 100); &#xA;    padding: 8px; &#xA;    text-align: left; &#xA;    border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(50 185 100); &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   #highlight { &#xA;    border: 2px solid gold; &#xA;   } &#xA;    &#xA;   p { &#xA;    font-size: 80%; &#xA;   } &#xA;  &lt;/style&gt; &#xA; &lt;/head&gt; &#xA; &lt;body&gt; &#xA;  &lt;table&gt; &#xA;   &lt;caption&gt;List of available tables&lt;/caption&gt; &#xA;   &lt;tr&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;Upcoming Events&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;Performers List&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;Venue List&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt; &#xA;   &lt;tr&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th id=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;Past Events&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th id=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;Old Props&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;Available Props&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt; &#xA;   &lt;tr&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;Crew List&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;VIP List&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th id=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;Old Performances&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt; &#xA;   &lt;tr&gt; &#xA;    &lt;th&gt;....&lt;/th&gt; &#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt; &#xA;  &lt;/table&gt; &#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Note: Yellow bordered tables need to be deleted&lt;/p&gt; &#xA; &lt;/body&gt; &#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Schema",
            "id": 121018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menampilkan daftar tabel, kita akan menggunakan <code>sqlite_schema</code> karena kita menggunakan SQLite. <code>sqlite_schema</code> adalah tabel yang menyimpan skema database.</p><p>Sebuah schema berisi informasi tentang database, termasuk detail tentang tabel.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sqlite_schema</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Table type",
            "id": 121020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah schema menyimpan banyak informasi tentang database. Mari tentukan bahwa kita hanya menginginkan tabel.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>type</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"table\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Selecting only the name",
            "id": 121019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat daftar tabel, kita hanya memerlukan kolom <code>name</code>. Jadi, mari <code>SELECT</code> kolom tersebut!</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"past_events\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "DROP TABLE",
            "id": 121021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah memiliki daftar tabel, mari hapus seluruh tabel <code>past_events</code> dengan query <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" past_events; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>DROP</code>, diikuti oleh <code>TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 121022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari pernyataan berikut yang benar tentang schema?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Schema berisi informasi tentang database</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah schema hanya berisi informasi tabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Schema berisi informasi tentang database.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah database memiliki beberapa tabel dan detail struktural lainnya. Pernyataan mana yang menjelaskan schema dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Schema berisi informasi tentang struktur database</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Schema hanya berisi baris yang tersimpan dalam satu tabel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Schema berisi hasil query terbaru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Schema berisi informasi tentang struktur database.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 121023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di mana daftar tabel disimpan dalam database kamu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">skema</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">kueri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih skema.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menambahkan tabel <code>payments</code>, lalu memeriksa daftar tabel dalam database. Di mana daftar tersebut disimpan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dalam schema</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dalam query yang membuat <code>payments</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dalam baris pertama tabel <code>payments</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Dalam schema.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 121024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menghapus tabel dari database SQLite?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu perlu menghapus seluruh tabel <code>archive</code> dari database SQLite, termasuk strukturnya. Perintah mana yang harus digunakan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM</code>, karena menghapus semua baris juga menghapus tabel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP DATABASE</code>, karena tabel hanya dapat dihapus bersama databasenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 121025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari berikut ini yang merupakan sintaks yang benar untuk menghapus sebuah tabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP tablename</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin menghapus tabel bernama <code>sessions</code>. Statement mana yang memiliki sintaks yang benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE sessions</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>DROP TABLE sessions</code>.</p></body></html>"
